Read one Ads Studio brand: how far its research got through the five stages (gather, synthesis, enrichment, products, assets) and what is already usable. Use this to answer "is the research done?" - status done means the brand and its products are ready. Call it when the user asks, not on a timer, and never in a loop: research can take several minutes. Follow next_step: a finished research is offered for ads, never generated on its own.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__higgsfield_ads_studio_get_brand(args: {
  // Ads Studio brand id, from ads_studio_list_brands or ads_studio_create_brand.
  brand_id: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{
  // Plans supported by Ads Studio.
  allowed_plans?: Array<string>;
  brand_id?: string;
  business_overview?: string;
  // Credits available when the request was refused.
  credits_have?: number;
  // Credits required for the refused request.
  credits_needed?: number;
  // Credits missing for the refused request.
  credits_short?: number;
  enrichment_error?: string;
  error?: string;
  error_code?: string;
  gather_error?: string;
  // The concurrent-generation limit when the queue was full.
  limit?: number;
  name?: string;
  next_step?: string;
  // The account's current plan when access was refused.
  plan?: string;
  products_error?: string;
  products_in_profile?: number;
  profile_ready?: boolean;
  // The queued generation count when the queue was full.
  queued?: number;
  research?: { current?: string; done_count?: number; stages?: Array<{ name: string; status: string; }>; total_count?: number; };
  // Why the research failed, in ai-cmo's own words.
  research_error?: string;
  status?: string;
  tagline?: string;
  target_audience?: string;
  updated_at?: string;
  website?: string;
}>>; };
```

