Get the cost without starting a generation, reserving credits or spending credits. A user request to create ads, including an exact allocation submitted from the Ads Studio app, authorizes this read-only quote: do not ask for separate permission to quote. Takes the same arguments as ads_studio_generate so the quote matches the run. After quoting a requested generation, show the exact allocation and total credits; use ask_user_input (or ask_user_input_v3) only when that exact host tool is available, otherwise ask one concise chat question. Never invent a host tool or generate before explicit approval of this allocation and cost. A price-only request needs only the quote, not a spending-approval question.

